<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="MAL" style="id">Malachi</book>
  <para style="h">Malachi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Malachi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Malachi</para>
  <para style="mt">Malachi</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel-ho hnêna Lalpa thuchhuak, Malakia kuta ziak chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa chuan, “Ka hmangaih che u a ni,” a ti a. Nangni erawh chuan, “Engah khân nge min hmangaih ni?” in ti a. “Esauva chu Jakoba unaupa a ni lo vem ni?” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni: “Jakoba chu ka hmangaih a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Esauva erawh chu ka hua a, A tlângte chu hmun ṭiauvah ka siam a, A ro chan chu thlalêr sihalte ka pe a.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Edom-ho chuan, “Tihchhiatin kan awm na a, Kan lo kîr leh ang a, hmun ramte chu kan din leh ang,” ti mah sela, Sipaihote Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Annin an din leh nâng a, keiin ka ṭhiat leh ang; Tin, mite chuan anni chu, Suahsualna ram leh Kumkhuaa Lalpa thinrim êm êmnateho, an ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />In mit ngeiin in hmu ang a, ‘Israel ramri pêlin Lalpa chu chawimawiin awm rawh se,’ nangmahni ngeiin in la ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Fapa chuan a pa a chawimawi ṭhîn a, bâwih chuan a pu. Kei hi pa ka nih chuan mi chawimawina chu khawiah nge? Kei hi in pu ka nih chuan mi ṭihna chu khawiah nge? Aw puithiam, ka hming hmusittute u,” Sipaihote Lalpa chuan a ti che u a ni. “Nangni erawh chuan, ‘Engah khân nge i hming kan hmuhsit ni?’ in ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka maichâmah chuan chhang bawlhhlawh in hlân alâwm. Nangnin, ‘Engah khân nge kan tihbawlhhlawh che?’ in ti a. Lalpa dawhkân hi hmuhsitawm a ni in tih ṭhinah hian a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Inthawi nân a mitdel in hlanin sualna a awm lo maw? A kebai leh a silawng in hlanin sualna a awm hek lo maw? In ram awptu pawh pe teh u; a lâwm dâwn che u em ni? A nih leh, a lo ngaisâng ang che u maw?” Sipaihote Lalpa chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Tûnah hian min khawngaih theih nân Pathian tihlungawina zawng rawh u khai - Hetiang hi in kutkawih ngei a ni si a - A lo ngaisâng dâwn che u em ni?” Sipaihote Lalpa chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Ka maichâmah chuan a thlâwn maia mei in tihalh loh nân In zîngah mi, kawngkhâr khâr tûr awm teh sela aw! In chungah lâwmna rêng ka nei lo va, In kut ata thilhlan chu ka pawm hek lo vang,” Sipaihote Lalpa chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Ni chhuahna aṭanga a tlâkna thleng pawhin Jentail-te zîngah ka hming chu a ropui si a; Hmun tinah ka hming atân rimtui hlan a ni, Thilhlan thianghlim nên; Jentail-te zîngah ka hming a ropui si a,” Sipaihote Lalpa chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Nangni erawh chu, ‘ Lalpa dawhkân chu a bawlhhlawh a ni; A rah, a chaw ngei chu a hmuhsitawm,’ in tihah khân a ni, A tibawrhbângtu in nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh u, ‘A va ninawm êm!’ in ti bawk a, In hnâr in tum khum a,” Sipaihote Lalpa chuan a ti: “Hnehchhuha in thil lâk te, a kebai te, a silawng te in rawn la a; Chutiangin thilhlan chu in rawn la a! Chûng chu in kut ata ka pawm dâwn em ni?” Lalpa chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“A ran ruala a pa awm renga, thu pawh tiama, Lalpa hnêna a hmêlhem hlâna bumtu chu ânchhe dawng a ni; Kei chu Lal ropui tak ka ni si a, ka hming pawh Jentail-te zîngah A ṭihawm a ni,” Sipaihote Lalpa chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Khai le, puithiamte u, he thupêk hi nangmahni tân a ni e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka hming tiropui tûra in ngaihthlâk lohva, thinlunga in vawn loh chuan, In chungah ânchhia ka rawn thlentîr ang,” Sipaihote Lalpa chuan a ti, “In malsâwmna dawnte chu ânchhia ka lawh ang. A ni, in zîngah thinlunga vawng in awm loh avângin Anchhia ka lawh tawh reng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ngai teh u, nangmahni vângin in chite chu ka zilhhau va, In hmaiahte chuan êk ka tât pherh ang, in kûtna êk ngei chu; Chumi nên chuan lâk bo in ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Levia hnêna ka thuthlung hi a din zêl theih nân, He thupêk hi in hnênah ka rawn chhuah a ni tih in hria ang,” Sipaihote Lalpa chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Ka thuthlung chu a hnênah a awm a; Nunna leh thlamuanna ka pe a, ṭih pawh mi ṭih a ni, Ka hming chu hlauh namênin a hlau lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thutak dân chu a kâah a awm a, thu sual a hmuiah a awm lo. Thlamuang tak leh ngîl takin ka hmaah a lêng ṭhîn a, Mi tam tak an khawlohna ata a inlamlêttîr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Puithiam hmuite chuan hriatna a vawng tûr a ni si a, A kâ aṭangin dân chu an zawng ṭhîn tûr a ni; Ani chu Sipaihote Lalpa tirhkoh a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nangni erawh zawng kawng ata chu in lo pêng ta a; Dânah chuan mi tam tak in petektîr a; Levia thuthlung chu in tichhia a ni,” Sipaihote Lalpa chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Chuvângin, kei pawhin, ka kawngte zawh tu mah in awm lohva, Dân thûa mi thlei bîk in neih zâwk ang zêl hian, Mi zawng zawng hmâah hmuhsitawm leh tlâwmin ka siam che u a ni.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kan vaiin Pa hmun kan ni lo vem ni? Pathian pakhat siam pawh kan ni lo vem ni? Engati nge kan pate thuthlung tibawrhbânga, Unau leh unau kan inbum ṭhin?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Juda chuan bum a hmang a, Israel ram leh Jerusalem khuaah Thil tenawm tih a ni a; Lalpan a hmangaih ṭhin hmun thianghlim chu, Juda chuan a tibawrhbâng ta si a: Ram dang pathian fanu a nei ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hetiang ti chu, tua pawh, Jakoba puan in ata Lalpan a tifihlîm vek ang, Sipaihote Lalpa hnêna thil hlântu chenin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, hei pawh hi in ti leh pek a: mittui leh ṭahna leh rûmnain Lalpa maichâm chu in chhilh hneh khawp a, Thilhlan a ngaihsak rêng rêng tawh lo va, In kuta mi chu lâwmawmah a ngai hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nangni chuan, “Eng vâng nge ni le?” in la han ti a. Nang leh i nupui tawn tirh inkâra thuhretu chu Lalpa a ni a, i kawppui leh i thuthlung nupui a ni nachungin, A chungah bumna thil i tih ṭhin vâng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nunna chi neiin, pumkhatah a siam lo vem ni? Engah nge pumkhata a siam? Chithlah, Pathian ngaihsak a zawng a ni. Tichuan, in nunna chu vêng ṭha ula, Tu mân mahni nupui tawn tirh chu bum suh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Inmâk hi ka haw si a,” Lalpa , Israel-ho Pathian chuan a ti; “Mahni silhfên hnehchhiahnaa khuhtu nên,” Sipaihote Lalpa chuan a ti. Tichuan, in nunna chu vêng ṭha ula, inbum suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />In thutein Lalpa chu in tihah ta. Nangni erawh chuan, “Engah khân nge kan tihhah?” in ti a. “Thil sual titu apiang Lalpa mit hmuhah mi ṭha an ni a, An chungah pawh ani chu a lâwm ṭhîn,” in tihah te, “Rorêl felna Pathian chu khawiah nge?” in tihahte hian a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Ngai teh u, ka tirhkoh ka rawn tîr a, Ka hmaah kawng a buatsaih ang. Tin, in zawn Lalpa chu a biak inah a lo kal phut ang; Ngai teh u, thuthlung tirhkoh in lawm êm êm chu a lo kal e,” Sipaihote Lalpa chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Amaherawhchu, a lo kal nî chu tu nge tuar zo vang? A lo lan hunah chuan tu nge ding thei ang? Ani chu rawh tuina mei ang leh puan sutute sahbawn ang a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Tangkaraw rawh tuitu leh tithianghlimtu angin a ṭhu ang a, Levia fate a tithianghlim ang a, Rangkachak leh tangkarua angin anmahni a tifai ang a; Lalpa tân chuan felnaa thil hlântute an ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chutichuan, hmasâng nite leh hmasâng kumte angin, Judai ram leh Jerusalem thilhlan chu Lalpa tân duhawm tak a ni leh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Rorêl tûrin ka rawn hnaih dâwn a che u; Dawithiamte, uirête, dâwta chhechhamtute chungah leh, Hmeithai leh fahrah leh inhlawhfa hlawh tikhawlova hnehchhiahtute leh, Hnam dang lo sât thlatute - mi ṭih lotute chungah chuan, Thuhretu ṭuanṭha tak ka ni ang,” Sipaihote Lalpa chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Kei Lalpa hi ka danglam si lo; chuvângin, nangni, Aw Jakoba fate u, tihboral in ni lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />In pûte hun ata tawh ka thuruatte in kal pênsan a, Zawm pawh in zâwm ngai lo. Ka hnênah lo kîr ula; Tichuan, in hnênah ka lo kîr ang,” Sipaihote Lalpa chuan a ti. “Nangni erawh chuan, ‘Engahte hian nge kan kîr ang?’ in ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mihringin Pathian ta chu a rûksak tûr em ni? Mahse, nangni chuan min rûksak ṭhîn. Nangni erawh chuan, ‘Engahte hian nge kan rûksak che?’ in ti a, Sâwma pakhat leh thilhlanahte hian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Anchhia lawh in ni ta; Nangni he hnam pum pui hian Kei hi min rûksak si ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka inah ei tûr a awm theih nân, sâwma pakhat zawng zawng chu Thawhlâwm inah rawn la rawh u; Vân tukverhte chu hawnsak che uin, Malsâwmna dawn sên loh khawp hial Ka vûr dâwn che u nge dâwn lo che u, mi han fiah teh rêng u,” Sipaihote Lalpa chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Eiraltu chu ka khapsak ang che u a; Tichuan, in lei rahte chu a tihchhiatsak tawh lo vang che u a, Huana in grêp rah chu a hlam tla ral tawh hek lo vang,” Sipaihote Lalpa chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Tin, hnam zawng zawngin engthâwl an ti ang che u a, Ram duhawm tak in la nih dâwn avângin,” Sipaihote Lalpa chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Ka chunga in thute chu a paukhauh hle,” Lalpa chuan a ti. Nangni erawh chuan, ‘Engah khân nge i chungah chutiang thu kan sawi?’ in ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />‘Pathian rawngbâwl hi a thlâwn a ni; A thuchah kan zawm leh Sipaihote Lalpa hmaa intilunghnûr taka kan lêng ṭhîn hi sâwtna eng nge awm?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, mi chapote chu an eng a thâwl e kan ti a, Thil suaksual titute chu an dingchang bawk a; Pathian an fiah a, chhanhim an ni bawk ṭhîn,’ ” in ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tichuan, Lalpa ṭihtute chu an inbe tlâng a, Lalpa chuan a lo ngaithla a, a lo hria a; Lalpa ṭihtute leh a hming ngaihsaktute tân, Hriat rengna lehkhabu chu a hmaah ziak a ni ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Ro chuam ka siam nîah chuan ka ta an ni ang,” Sipaihote Lalpa chuan a ti; “Tin, miin a fapa, a rawngbâwlsaktu chu a zuat angin anni chu ka zuat ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tichuan, in inlamlêt ang a, mi fel leh mi suaksual, Pathian rawngbâwltu leh bâwl lotu chu in thliar thei tawh ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Ngai teh u, ni chu a lo thleng e, Rawh tuina mei angin a kâng a ni; Mi chapo zawng zawngte leh sual titu zawng zawngte chu Buhpâwl an ni ang a, chu ni lo thleng chuan anmahni a kâng ang; Zung leh zâr chenin a zuah lo vang,” Sipaihote Lalpa chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Nangni ka hming ṭihtute tân erawh chuan Felna ni, a thlaa tihdamna nên a lo chhuak ang a, In kal chhuak ang a, bâwngnote hrên lai thaukhawh angin in tualchai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi suaksualte chu in rap bet ang a; Nî ka ruatah chuan in kephah hnuaia meivâp an ni dâwn si a,” Sipaihote Lalpa chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Ka chhiahhlawh Mosia dân, Horeb tlânga a hnêna ka thupêk, Israel mi zawng zawng tâna thuruatte leh Rorêlnate kha hre reng rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ngai teh u, Lalpa ni ropui leh râpthlâk tak a lo thlen hmain, Zâwlnei Elija chu in hnênah ka rawn tîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ani chuan pa leh fate inkârah Inrem lehna a thlentîr ang; Chuti a nih loh chuan, ka lo kal ang a, Anchhiain lei hi ka nghaisa dah ang e.”
  </para>
</usx>
